, consumer, telecom, power supply, industrial and medical, and computing markets. Shenzhen Kinwong Electronic Co., Ltd. was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Shenzhen, China.","description_en":"Shenzhen Kinwong Electronic Co., Ltd. engages in research, development, production, and sale of printed circuit boards (PCB) and electronic materials in China and internationally. The company offers conventional PCBs, including single-layer, double-layer, and multi-layer PCBs; metal-based PCBs that comprise copper, aluminum, stainless steel, and iron; flexible PCBs, such as single and double side, and multilayer PCBs; and high density interconnect, RF microwave, rigid-flex, high layer count, substrate-like PCBs, as well as copper inlays. It also provides engineering and design services. The company serves automotive, smart terminal, consumer, telecom, power supply, industrial and medical, and computing markets. Shenzhen Kinwong Electronic Co., Ltd. was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Shenzhen, China.","description_zh":"深圳景旺電子股份有限公司在中國及國際從事印刷電路板（PCB）及電子材料的研發、生產和銷售。該公司提供傳統印刷電路板，包括單層、雙層和多層印刷電路板；金屬基印刷電路板，包含銅、鋁、不鏽鋼和鐵；柔性印刷電路板，例如單面、雙面和多層印刷電路板；以及高密度互連、射頻微波、軟硬結合板、高層數板、類載板，以及銅嵌件。它還提供工程和設計服務。該公司服務於汽車、智能終端、消費電子、電信、電源、工業和醫療以及計算市場。深圳景旺電子股份有限公司成立於一九九三年，總部位於中國深圳。","address":"166 Tiegang Shuiku Road","city":"Shenzhen","state":"GD","zip":"518102","country":"CN","phone":null,"full_address":"166 Tiegang Shuiku Road, Shenzhen, GD, 518102, CN","year_high":88,"year_low":57.05,"range_52w":"57.05-88","all_time_high":null,"all_time_low":null,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[],"stock_splits":[],"news":[],"historical_dcf_series":null,"real_5y_prices":[],"dataAvailability":{"currentPrice":null,"hkdRiskFreeRate":"usdTreasuryProxyNotObservedHkdYield","asReportedLeases":"sourceUnavailable","ownership":"Provider coverage has not been verified for HKEX","historicalDcf":"No point-in-time historical valuations are available"},"ratingSources"